AB  - This study conducts a case analysis of the works of AI fashion artist “Str4ngeThing” to explore how the theories and idea-driven characteristics of conceptual art are expressed in generative AI fashion images. The artist is highly regarded for his innovative designs, using generative AI to blend and reinterpret modern iconic fashion with historical Renaissance aesthetics. This study identifies four key features of his work based on the conceptual art elements of ready-made, intervention, text, and material form. It focuses on the use of ready-made objects, the fusion of historical periods with iconic brands through intervention, the application of fashion typography, and the creation of dynamic images that transcend physical limitations. These demonstrate how AI amplifies human creativity, enabling designers to explore new visual ideas beyond traditional methods. This study aims to comprehend how AI technology the creation of fashion images, while also exploring new methods of fashion design and image production. Moreover, this study offers significant insights into how AI technology can support, rather than replace, human creativity.
