AB  - Uniforms serve as a visual language for expressing a company’s image and identity, reflecting functionality, aesthetics, and symbolism through the shape, color, and material of formative elements that align with the company’s image. In this study, we used ChatGPT-4 to try and create a design for work uniforms in the architectural field. We wanted to create a design that is different from the current design development process and evaluate whether it is practically useful as a draft for a uniform design proposal in the architectural field. By attempting to develop a design that reflects the CI of architectural company M, we deduced that artificial intelligence (AI) can provide creative ideas in the design development conception stage but confirmed that time and effort are needed for modification in the detailed design. Overall, this study aims to identify the strengths and weaknesses of advanced AI technology through repeated learning and to suggest directions for efficient use.
